  "content": "<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">鐵之魔法與魔法書：奧術精華方塊</span><br><br><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">此為「鐵之魔法與魔法書」模組的擴充內容</span><br><br>本模組需搭配<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irons-spells-n-spellbooks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9;text-decoration:underline\">鐵之魔法與魔法書</span></a></span><br><br></p><p>受夠堆積如山的奧術精華了嗎？隆重推出：精華囊袋、奧術精華方塊與奧術錠方塊：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1215/299/arcane_essenc_page-png.png\"></p><p>看看我的其他作品：<br><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/updated-ice-and-fire-copper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1083218/description_8d266393-1ff4-44cc-917e-72b19cdd4db2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-exorcism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1083218/description_73167cbf-78f2-49bf-9c83-361391aa6cc1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\"></a><br><br>並加入我的Discord：<br><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/66vEhErVG6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1083218/description_48ac473a-c938-4d7d-aea5-e7af94c2119d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"171\" height=\"171\"></a></p>",
